---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Contact — The Rake"
  description="Get in touch with The Rake — questions, corrections, research tips, or general correspondence."
>

<main class="contact-page">
  <div class="contact-page__inner">

    <header class="contact-header">
      <p class="mono muted contact-kicker">Contact</p>
      <h1 class="contact-title">Get in touch</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="contact-body">

      <section class="contact-section">
        <p>The best way to reach The Rake is by email. Whether you have a question about a report, spotted something that looks wrong, have a source tip, or want to suggest a company for a future issue — I'd genuinely like to hear from you.</p>
        <p><a href="mailto:craig@fluke.design" class="contact-link">craig@fluke.design</a></p>
      </section>

      <section class="contact-section">
        <h2>What I'm particularly interested in</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Corrections</strong> — if something in a report is factually wrong, I want to fix it. Please include the specific claim and a source.</li>
          <li><strong>Source tips</strong> — primary documents, leaked materials, or underreported stories that bear on a company's alignment with users.</li>
          <li><strong>Company suggestions</strong> — which tech company should The Rake cover next, and why.</li>
          <li><strong>Methodology feedback</strong> — if you've done something similar and can see ways to make the scoring more rigorous, I'd genuinely welcome it.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="contact-section">
        <h2>Response times</h2>
        <p>The Rake is a one-person operation. I read every message but can't guarantee a reply to all of them. If your message relates to a factual error in a report, I treat that as a priority and will respond as quickly as I can.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="contact-section">
        <h2>Press and republication</h2>
        <p>If you'd like to quote or republish content from The Rake, please get in touch before doing so. Analysis and scoring rubrics are original work and I ask that attribution is included in any republication. Brief quotation with a link to the source report is fine without prior contact.</p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</main>

</Base>

<style>
.contact-page { padding: 0 var(--gutter); }
.contact-page__inner {
  max-width: var(--max-w);
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.contact-header {
  padding: 4rem 0 3rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.contact-kicker { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.contact-title {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2rem);
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.3;
}
.contact-body { padding: 0 0 4rem; }
.contact-section {
  padding: 2.5rem 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.contact-section:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.contact-section h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}
.contact-section p {
  font-size: 1.125rem;
  line-height: 1.8;
  margin-bottom: 1.25em;
}
.contact-section p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.contact-section ul {
  list-style: none;
  margin-bottom: 1.25em;
}
.contact-section ul li {
  font-size: 1.125rem;
  line-height: 1.8;
  padding-left: 1.25rem;
  position: relative;
  margin-bottom: 0.5em;
}
.contact-section ul li::before {
  content: '—';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  color: var(--text-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
}
.contact-link {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: var(--text);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
  padding-bottom: 1px;
  transition: border-color 0.15s;
}
.contact-link:hover { border-color: var(--text); }
</style>
